AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding dataset

  Licence: CC-BY 4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt)
  Attribution: The AlphaEarth Foundations Satellite Embedding dataset is
  produced by Google and Google DeepMind.
